uestion/problem "An inner product on $V={R}^{3}$ is defined as $⟨x,y⟩={x}_{1}{y}_{1}+2{x}_{2}{y}_{2}+{x}_{3}{y}_{3}.$ \nCalculate the norm of the vector $v=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}]$ under this inner product." :question/worked-solution "The norm of a vector $v$ with respect to an inner product $⟨\\cdot ,\\cdot ⟩$ is defined as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}‖v‖=\\sqrt{⟨v,v⟩}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing $‖v‖$ using our definition, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}‖v‖ & =\\sqrt{⟨v,v⟩} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{2\\cdot 2+2\\cdot ((-1)\\cdot (-1))+4\\cdot 4} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{4+2+16} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{22}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-43929/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "92053541-63fa-5cca-b3d8-0f4864c31051"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-43929"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-141169/selection/0c8b08d4b198d89c5fe756f861bd5b37e398d2a5b3237908210d9646370a666f" :answer/id #uuid "e9246526-6397-51af-84ff-fd20e1968f7c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\sqrt{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-141169/selection/af5580a233ee3709064249d6732fc822dfb93f38caf90c025deb51b127e90b2c" :answer/id #uuid "8099fbd5-73ae-5375-8669-a07d81e63522" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\sqrt{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-141169/selection/e59e169232e16e8d4fc95e4d14f7ebab8f0ea66430d2fabd4381548437f83344" :answer/id #uuid "bfcd88d2-e52c-53c0-b0f4-10496abe8f45" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4\\sqrt{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-141169/selection/7f76893339431fbe1025dfc34a81e64480edf5168d046d69b36669516297505c" :answer/id #uuid "fa06301a-1535-56c0-afde-4e1d6cc066c1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\sqrt{10}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-141169/selection/4ef0fcc340e40ad6bcef1c832215cd28abf240aabeed43296dfece28d20d1935" :answer/id #uuid "3a4194c8-dda6-52a9-9